# tracer: nop
#
# Curated excerpt of a real HarmonyOS device capture whose print-mark
# converter (trace_streamer suspect) dropped the leading action character
# (B|/E|/C|/S|/F|) and left a "0x0:" address residue, so standard hitrace
# print marks arrive as "print: 0x0: <pid>[|<name>][|I<tag>]".
# Rows below are the real q7_line140711 neighborhood; the closing E for the
# com.xs.fm.lite bindApplication span is appended (from the same thread's
# later close) so span_window can pair B/E on the restored marks. Pairing keys
# on the ftrace ROW pid (6565), not on the payload pid: N=15 is the
# container-ns pid and identifies the span subject only (constant across
# setCoreSettings/bindApplication spans).
# Tags ride End and Begin tails as <UPPER><digits>: I38/I33 (instance) and the
# M0538 marker rows exercise the non-I tag family from undamaged reference caps.
# The two counter rows are carved forms of real donghu counter payloads
# (5-field value-mid "C|1252|H:VSync-rs|0|I38" and 4-field "C|43417|VSYNC-app|1")
# — they must restore to C|, never forge a sync span.
  com.xs.fm.lite-6565   ( 6565) [007] ....  3680.819354: print: 0x0: 15|setCoreSettings
  com.xs.fm.lite-6565   ( 6565) [007] ....  3680.819359: print: 0x0: 15
 OS_IPC_25_48445-48445  ( 1248) [004] ....  3680.819366: print: 0x0: 48|H:validateDisplay|I38
