 OS_IPC_25_48445-48445  ( 1248) [004] ....  3680.819457: print: 0x0: 48|I38
 OS_IPC_25_48445-48445  ( 1248) [004] ....  3680.819458: print: 0x0: 48|I38
   OS_HCodecLoop-50842  (40663) [000] ....  3680.819478: print: 0x0: 663|H:[hcodec][8_e]WaitFence for seq=2664897987|I33
   RSUniRenderThr-1727  ( 1727) [002] ....  3680.819500: print: 0x0: 1727|H:RSUniRenderThread::Render()|M0538
   RSUniRenderThr-1727  ( 1727) [002] ....  3680.819520: print: 0x0: 1727|M0538
   RSHardwareThr-1450   ( 1252) [003] ....  3680.819600: print: 0x0: 1252|H:VSync-rs|0|I38
  OS_VSyncThread-43418  (43417) [001] ....  3680.819610: print: 0x0: 43417|VSYNC-app|1
